      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹25.70 (vs ₹1.26 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹25.70 (up from ₹1.26 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹725.8m (up 40% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹18.3m (up ₹17.4m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.5% (up from 0.2% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 22% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 39% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
